{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land was absolved, it fell to an ancient darkness, a spell cast by a mysterious force. Two beings from a pure realm of light are the only hope for this consumed land. To purify and restore the land to it's former self one must collect all of the Kai Shards from each of the realm doors on the Ancestral Bridge of Kresallia.\u00a0<strong>DARKODAI</strong>\u00a0awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942570/extras/d70632e40c255e4249e72b5c6a85b22e.avif?t=1766180709\" width=220 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on a quest to restore the light by collecting all of the Kai Shards in each Darkodai Door that lead to other realms, and maybe encounter a few secrets DARKODAI has to offer...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many unique characters, friend and foe to meet in the darkness. Be careful who you choose to trust.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If quests aren't what you are after then perhaps collecting a few rare items, costumes or companions is more of your style?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >James and Laura, two beings of light await your\u00a0guidance, the realm will only become darker under the moonlight the longer they wait...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DARKODAI is powered by the <strong>RPG Maker MV</strong>\u00a0engine. The in-game music is from the <strong>RPG Maker MV</strong> engine. The trailer music is composed by\u00a0<strong>Irene Chan</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3942570?t=1766180709","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942570/374fbb20245db1cd112dd133ae6c1b20dcfa3bb2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766180709","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942570/d27000d131e3bf471c279f001ef655a0371d5deb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766180709","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942570/d27000d131e3bf471c279f001ef655a0371d5deb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766180709","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3954810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land was absolved, it fell to an ancient darkness, a spell cast by a mysterious force. Two beings from a pure realm of light are the only hope for this consumed land. To purify and restore the land to it's former self one must collect all of the Kai Shards from each of the realm doors on the Ancestral Bridge of Kresallia.\u00a0<strong>DARKODAI</strong>\u00a0awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942570/extras/d70632e40c255e4249e72b5c6a85b22e.avif?t=1766180709\" width=220 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on a quest to restore the light by collecting all of the Kai Shards in each Darkodai Door that lead to other realms, and maybe encounter a few secrets DARKODAI has to offer...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many unique characters, friend and foe to meet in the darkness. Be careful who you choose to trust.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If quests aren't what you are after then perhaps collecting a few rare items, costumes or companions is more of your style?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >James and Laura, two beings of light await your\u00a0guidance, the realm will only become darker under the moonlight the longer they wait...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DARKODAI is powered by the <strong>RPG Maker MV</strong>\u00a0engine. The in-game music is from the <strong>RPG Maker MV</strong> engine. The trailer music is composed by\u00a0<strong>Irene Chan</strong>.</p>","developers":["Logan TimeLierG Eberly"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942570/bf541d7a09279a31492985744d05a932ebb53ac3/header.jpg?t=1766180709","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92024-2025 Logan TimeLierG Eberly","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3942570/1388217704/46e750df9968314b30c8ec189908f1293a6f92f0/1766179801/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766180707","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3942570/1388217704/46e750df9968314b30c8ec189908f1293a6f92f0/1766179801/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766180707","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3942570/1388217704/46e750df9968314b30c8ec189908f1293a6f92f0/1766179801/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766180707","id":257182393,"name":"DARKODAI Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257182393/aed545a6eeabd824d2bad019b9294f93d41925ac/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766180707"}],"name":"DARKODAI","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft\u00ae Windows\u00ae Vista / 7 (32-bit/64-bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Pentium\u00ae 4 2.0 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 5 GB RAM<br></li><